The API surface is reverse-engineered and documented in
[`docs/{{.Name}}-api-discovery.md`](docs/{{.Name}}-api-discovery.md); every
catalog and cart type is pinned to a real captured response by a fixture
round-trip test (`internal/api/testdata/*.json`), so response↔type drift fails
in CI, not in the field.

## Success criteria

The catalog MVP is **done** when these all work end-to-end with `--json` output
and the fixture tests pass:

- [ ] `{{.Name}} search <query>` — full-text search.
- [ ] `{{.Name}} product <id>` — full product detail.
- [ ] `{{.Name}} cart {get,add,set,remove,clear}` — guest cart (no login).
- [ ] `{{.Name}} login --token <value>` / `whoami` / `logout`.
- [ ] Every command accepts `--json` for machine-readable stdout.
- [ ] `go test ./...` passes against captured real-response fixtures.
- [ ] Single static Go binary, only stdlib + cobra.

## Quickstart

```sh
# Build (requires Go 1.26+).
go build -o bin/{{.Name}} ./cmd/{{.Name}}

# Search the catalog (no login needed):
./bin/{{.Name}} search <query> --json

# Product detail:
./bin/{{.Name}} product <id>

# Guest cart (no login required; persists under ~/.{{.Name}}/session.json):
./bin/{{.Name}} cart get
./bin/{{.Name}} cart add <id> 2
./bin/{{.Name}} --max 50 cart add <id> 3   # spending guard

# Account auth (token path recommended for agents/CI):
export {{.Upper}}_ACCESS_TOKEN=<value>
./bin/{{.Name}} whoami
./bin/{{.Name}} logout

# Persistent defaults (~/.{{.Name}}/config.json):
./bin/{{.Name}} config set max_eur 50
./bin/{{.Name}} config get
```

State lives under `~/.{{.Name}}/` (override with `{{.Upper}}_HOME`):
`session.json` (0600 — guest session + account token when logged in) and
`config.json` (0600 — defaults like `max_eur`).

## Layout

Built with the [`shop-cli`](https://github.com/pmontp19/shop-cli-skill) process.

```
cmd/{{.Name}}/main.go        entrypoint (exit 0 on success, 1 on error)
internal/client              transport: session cookies + auth headers
internal/config              ~/.{{.Name}}/{session,config}.json (0600); env overlay
internal/auth                JWT decode; <flow>
internal/api                 typed operations + fixture round-trip tests
internal/cli                 cobra commands + runtime + rendering
docs/{{.Name}}-api-discovery.md   reverse-engineering notes
```

